      "message": "FYI, I was attempting to do this some time ago. I pushed the change now [1] so that you can have a look.\n\nComparing this with your change, I think it’s easier to create the submit requirements in AllProjectsCreator where we already create other submit requirements such as the \"No-Unresolved-Comments\" submit requirement.\n\nFWIW ideally the default Code-Review submit requirement should disallow self-approvals, e.g. be \"label:Code-Review\u003dMAX,user\u003dnon_uploader AND -label:Code-Review\u003dMIN\" rather than \"label:Code-Review\u003dMAX AND -label:Code-Review\u003dMIN\", but this is much more work as most of our integration tests assume that self-approval is possible (that\u0027s why I gave up on my change). So it\u0027s better if this is only done in a follow-up change.\n\n[1] https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/c/gerrit/+/449283",
